OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer on trial facing
OL,4,Arape and sexual assault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old police officer from
OL,7,FShetland has gone on trial facing
OL,8,Fmultiple rape and sexual assault
OL,9,Fcharges.
OL,11,FCarmichael John Williamson - known as
OL,12,FJohn Williamson - denies charges at the
OL,13,FHigh Court in Edinburgh.
OL,15,FThe first day of the trial heard
OL,16,Fevidence from a witness who said she
OL,17,Fwas too drunk to give consent to sex
OL,18,Fwith the accused.
OL,20,FThe woman said she had gone into a
OL,21,Ffreeze response during another
OL,22,Fincident.
